<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: Sentinel and equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Reach the Poop Deck and activate the Sentinel Artifact. Activate the Pack-a-Punch pedestals around the ship and build the shield.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Obtain the Kraken and its upgrade components. Keep access to elemental ammunition for the later pipe step.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-clocks">Clocks and elemental outlets</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-clocks-1" data-guide-step>Find the four clocks that changed from their default time and identify their nearby elemental symbols. Record each hour and minute under the matching element.</li>
<li id="guide-step-clocks-2" data-guide-step>Set the bridge minute controls and the Engine Room/Poop Deck hour controls to the observed target times, matching the control symbols shown in the source diagrams.</li>
<li id="guide-step-clocks-3" data-guide-step>Locate the elemental outlets and perform their catalyst tasks in Poison → Water → Electric → Fire order. Finish the corresponding trials.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-voyage-clocks" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pipes">Pipes and celestial sequence</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-pipes-1" data-guide-step>Use the poison Kraken to break the leaking pipes, then complete the artifact/Pack-a-Punch interaction that opens the next quest stage.</li>
<li id="guide-step-pipes-2" data-guide-step>Locate the celestial symbols and record the displayed sequence. Use the map landmarks to identify which object to shoot and where its pickup appears.</li>
<li id="guide-step-pipes-3" data-guide-step>Collect the celestial pickups in order, handling the Sun at the final stage. Keep the current step visible before moving to the next location.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-voyage-sky" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-boss">Freezing route and Eye</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-boss-1" data-guide-step>Complete the freezing escape route by clearing ice obstacles and reaching the destination within the in-game limit.</li>
<li id="guide-step-boss-2" data-guide-step>Prepare equipment before the boss transition. Survive the Eye’s arena stages, use cover against its charged attacks and damage its exposed weak point.</li>
